OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands welcome UK-EU deal
OL,5,FIt would also allow islanders aged 18  
OL,6,Fto 31 to live, work, volunteer and     
OL,7,Fstudy in the EU for two years and      
OL,8,FChannel Islands students studying at UK
OL,9,Fhigher education settings will be able 
OL,10,Fto study in Europe.                    
